== Optional runtime ==

For video formats AVFoundation cannot play, Loupe looks for a libmpv the user has
installed separately (for example with Homebrew). libmpv is not included in or
distributed with Loupe; it is loaded at run time from the user's own installation
and remains under its own license (GPL-2.0+ / LGPL-2.1+, depending on how it was built).


== Test fixtures ==

Everything under fixtures/ is generated by the scripts in scripts/ from synthetic
content (Pillow drawings, ffmpeg test patterns and tones, textutil, openpyxl) or written
by hand for this project. Files that cannot be redistributed — copies of system fonts
and documents produced by Apple's iWork with its theme artwork — are not part of the
repository; scripts/gen-fixtures.py and scripts/gen-iwork-fixtures.sh recreate them
locally from the user's own system.


